  "id": "20260920-v3-stage-cp11j-policy-data-relocation",
  "title": "Relocate IFX policy data into the Post stage",
  "goal": "Make stages/post/policy the sole runtime location for IFX Post-stage policy data while retaining only the transitional authority registry under policy/.",
  "acceptanceCriteria": [
    "LayerGuard policy, Plan 05 baseline and G03/G04/G05 projections exist only under stages/post/policy.",
    "The authority registry, stage manifests, command manifest and policy registry reference the new locations.",
    "The base projection generator reproduces all derived policy files from the explicit head authorities.",
    "Architecture tests pass with the unchanged composite hash, tool version, binding count and required check name.",
    "Authored guidance and generated views contain no live references to the removed policy data paths.",
    "Trusted Diff and trusted-component candidate validation pass with exact move, TCB and policy/config authorization consumption."
  ],
